on damage of player:
    if attacker is a player:
        send "[PVP] %now% | %attacker% -> %victim% | Schaden: %damage% | Ort: %location of victim%" to console

    else if attacker is a projectile:
        if shooter of attacker is a player:
            send "[PVP] %now% | %shooter of attacker% -> %victim% | Fernkampf | Schaden: %damage% | Ort: %location of victim%" to console